### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@api = {{baseUrl}}/api/v1

### 1. Health Check Probe
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

### 2. Get All Food Menu Items
GET {{api}}/menu
Accept: application/json

### 3. Filter Menu by Category (e.g., Pizza)
GET {{api}}/menu?category=Pizza
Accept: application/json

### 4. Search Menu by Keyword (e.g., Burger)
GET {{api}}/menu?search=Burger
Accept: application/json

### 5. Create New Food Order (Valid Happy Path)
# Replace menuItemId with a valid GUID obtained from the menu endpoint
POST {{api}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Jane Doe",
  "deliveryAddress": "742 Evergreen Terrace, Springfield",
  "phoneNumber": "+1-555-0199",
  "items": [
    {
      "menuItemId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
      "quantity": 2
    }
  ]
}

### 6. Create Order with Invalid Data (Triggers 400 Validation Problem Details)
POST {{api}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "customerName": "",
  "deliveryAddress": "123",
  "phoneNumber": "not-a-phone",
  "items": []
}

### 7. Get Order Details by Internal ID
GET {{api}}/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json

### 8. Track Order by Public Human-Readable Order Number
GET {{api}}/orders/by-number/ORD-20261013-1234
Accept: application/json

### 9. Get Paginated Orders Collection (Kitchen Dashboard)
GET {{api}}/orders?page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

### 10. Filter Orders by Status
GET {{api}}/orders?page=1&pageSize=10&status=OrderReceived
Accept: application/json

### 11. Advance Order Status to "Preparing"
PATCH {{api}}/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/status
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "status": "Preparing"
}

### 12. Advance Order Status to "OutForDelivery"
PATCH {{api}}/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/status
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "status": "OutForDelivery"
}

### 13. Mark Order as "Delivered"
PATCH {{api}}/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/status
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "status": "Delivered"
}

### 14. Attempt Illegal Status Transition (Triggers 422 Invalid Order Operation)
PATCH {{api}}/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/status
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "status": "Preparing"
}

### 15. Delete / Cancel Order (Only Permitted When OrderReceived or Cancelled)
DELETE {{api}}/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json
